{"description":"在持有者身上裝一個有層數的具名標記（【試煉】【風王結界】【縮地】），可跨回合、可永久，並可選擇讓它變成一張免死牌：受致命傷害時消耗一層 → 無敵 → 回復 → 擊退暈眩周圍敵人；每失去一層永久獲得一組加成。⚠️ 落差：無敵/回復/擊退是救活的同一格一起發生，文案上的「隨後」看不出來 —— ⛔ 那是**這張模板**尚未把回復／擊退接上延後排程，⛔ 不是引擎沒有：引擎**有** `kind:\"delayed\"`（`delaySec`／`count`／`intervalSec`／`effects`，出貨例：初號機 `godie-e00r` 的 berserk_smoke），⭐ 但 lethalSave 的 `selfEffects`／`aoeEffects` 是同格跑的；要接延後得另驗死亡／重觸發／施法者狀態／排程取消的時序，⛔ 不是改說明就算做了（GH#1044）；火圈燒傷不走傷害佇列，這張免死牌擋不到它。","exemplar":{"jass":"無 JASS 出處 —— owner 2026-08-08 口述規格，不是從 war3map.j 復原的家族","skill":"52-00 十二道試煉（海克力斯 Berserker 天生技）"},"family":"mark-stacks","gapScore":8,"id":"tpl-mark-stacks","name":"具名標記-層數與免死","params":{"aoeRadius":{"default":6,"max":12,"min":0,"type":"number"},"durationSec":{"default":-1,"max":600,"min":-1,"type":"number","unit":"s"},"initial":{"default":12,"max":999,"min":0,"type":"number","unit":"count"},"internalCooldown":{"default":0.5,"max":30,"min":0,"type":"number","unit":"s"},"invulnerableScope":{"default":"damageAndControl","type":"enum","values":["damageAndControl","damageOnly"]},"invulnerableSec":{"default":1.5,"max":30,"min":0.1,"type":"number","unit":"s"},"knockbackDistance":{"default":4,"max":20,"min":0.1,"optional":true,"type":"number"},"knockbackFrom":{"default":"caster","type":"enum","values":["caster","facing","pull"]},"knockbackSpeed":{"default":16,"max":40,"min":1,"type":"number"},"lethalConsume":{"default":1,"max":999,"min":1,"type":"number","unit":"count"},"lethalDamageTypes":{"default":"all","type":"enum","values":["all","physicalMagic","physical","magic","true"]},"lethalMode":{"default":"save","type":"enum","values":["save","none"]},"markId":{"default":"godie-hapm.passive","type":"docRef"},"max":{"default":12,"max":999,"min":1,"type":"number","unit":"count"},"perStackLost":{"default":[{"op":"pctAdd","stat":"ad","value":0.1},{"op":"pctAdd","stat":"maxHealth","value":0.1}],"optional":true,"type":"statModifiers"},"resetOn":{"default":"match","type":"enum","values":["match","round","never"]},"restoreHealthPct":{"default":